{"id":2654,"bodyHtml":"<DIV><div><p>1月13日下午三点，经济与管理学院25级全体心理委员专题培训在心理发展中心顺利开展，本次培训由我校大学生心理发展指导中心的高林老师主讲。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=IMRG58MNCao7r7oCz-4UzQRL4LDnmNQboznkMzV2LzGaolU0gihFp2hmCIa0USyZMSyiLShfL7-iUllbUmQVMz6fMNLYnzUbL8LaU4linRWFn7Q2L8QVozAFUmnfLmGJv2bjo4OeoDX/_I6O_dN0qIbtpYyPLRLig4-PMmCbgtA8pUqcc&oid=1280026481&tid=1035&nid=21669&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/A8551A0B5AE9B6E57A6C2E493C0C55D2/DFF3FE98/B4A20\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 565px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=IozV5RL8W2nlrVMC4U8LmNDo7n7LlnQfM494oR7ioRGYUmC0gihFp2hmCIa0okybM1y4n1hRLzLDnN-sL47aM774ozL4oz9ZnlV2Uz-DL4WFUmMVnNCPL7MFLz67nzQ7gjfJQ4Oeo4x/qjTjpdAbgDTJQty0LzG4MSyYLzCDoSbw62q8c&oid=1280026481&tid=1035&nid=21669&e=.png\"></p><p>培训中，高林老师围绕心理委员的岗位职责、心理危机识别方法、沟通技巧及转介流程展开讲解，结合班级常见心理问题案例剖析，内容贴合实际工作需求。参训心委认真学习、积极交流，纷纷表示收获颇丰，将把所学知识运用到日常工作中，更好地为同学心理健康保驾护航。</p><p> 此次培训成效显著，切实增强了心理委员的专业素养与实操本领，为学院构建常态化心理健康预警机制、织密织牢心理健康防护网奠定了坚实根基。</p><p><br></p></div></DIV>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://jgy.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=IMRG58MNCao7r7oCz-4UzQRL4LDnmNQboznkMzV2LzGaolU0gihFp2hmCIa0USyZMSyiLShfL7-iUllbUmQVMz6fMNLYnzUbL8LaU4linRWFn7Q2L8QVozAFUmnfLmGJv2bjo4OeoDX/_I6O_dN0qIbtpYyPLRLig4-PMmCbgtA8pUqcc&oid=1280026481&tid=1035&nid=21669&e=.png"}